Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Generalize external signer to all channel keys
 (ExternalChannelSigner)

NodeChannelSigner can now externalize every channel key: funding, payment,
delayed-payment, HTLC and revocation basepoints plus per-commitment
secrets (KeyCoverage::AllChannelKeys), or only the funding key
